WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.260
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:39.530 --> 01:41.080
<i>What's going on?</i>

01:46.040 --> 01:47.830
<i>What's up with him?!</i>

01:56.800 --> 02:00.470
<i>I want you to quit being a Kaitou.</i>

02:09.480 --> 02:12.070
<i>Who does he think he is?!</i>

02:12.070 --> 02:15.320
<i>That was my first kiss...</i>

02:16.320 --> 02:18.860
Maron...

02:21.570 --> 02:26.580
<i>Why? Why did I just think about Chiaki?</i>

02:31.130 --> 02:37.800
A Sudden Approach! The Hurricane of Love Hits

02:38.760 --> 02:43.760
Geez! Just quit thinking about it, Maron!

02:43.760 --> 02:45.970
Just forget it!

02:45.970 --> 02:48.180
It was only a kiss--

02:48.180 --> 02:49.770
Hey! What was that for?!

02:49.770 --> 02:51.690
What do you mean "only?!"

02:52.360 --> 02:55.780
<i>I came to fight you. To win.</i>

02:55.780 --> 02:57.650
<i>I won't lose.</i>

02:57.650 --> 03:00.360
Whatever...

03:00.360 --> 03:03.740
Telling me now to quit being a Kaitou...

03:04.660 --> 03:06.660
What could he be thinking?!

03:06.660 --> 03:08.580
That's easy.

03:08.580 --> 03:09.460
What is?

03:09.460 --> 03:12.380
You see, Sinbad is an enemy.

03:12.380 --> 03:16.550
Whenever Jeanne seals a Demon, God regains some of His energy.

03:16.550 --> 03:19.840
However, whenever Sinbad seals a Demon...

03:19.840 --> 03:24.680
...the Devil gains energy and God's energy fades.

03:24.680 --> 03:27.060
I know, so what?

03:27.060 --> 03:30.060
It's easier to do without competition!

03:30.060 --> 03:31.770
So that's why...!

03:31.770 --> 03:37.280
Darn that Sinbad! I'll never quit being a Kaitou, no matter what!

03:42.070 --> 03:44.950
Maron, where are you going?!

03:44.950 --> 03:47.240
Getting mad made me hungry!

03:52.080 --> 03:55.170
You look like you're going out for dinner...

03:55.170 --> 03:56.380
Shall we go together?

03:56.380 --> 03:57.040
Huh?

04:00.470 --> 04:03.090
Um, I'm going alone.

04:13.350 --> 04:16.270
What's wrong? Did you hurt your leg?

04:18.150 --> 04:19.150
It's nothing!

04:28.370 --> 04:32.750
<i>I don't know why, but I feel sort of guilty...</i>

04:32.750 --> 04:34.330
<i>Why?</i>

04:35.370 --> 04:39.550
Why do I have to feel this way about Chiaki?!

04:54.060 --> 04:59.360
Hey, Maron! Get moving! We'll be late for practice.

04:59.360 --> 05:02.440
It's not like we're actually going to be late!

05:02.440 --> 05:04.110
There's no school today!

05:04.110 --> 05:07.620
Don't be so lazy! There's an important tournament tomorrow!

05:07.620 --> 05:09.450
C'mon, hurry it up!

05:11.450 --> 05:13.250
What is it?

05:13.250 --> 05:14.870
- It's...

05:13.870 --> 05:14.870
- It's not fair...<i></i>

05:15.870 --> 05:18.380
It's not fair, Chiaki-san!

05:19.460 --> 05:21.170
Chiaki?

05:21.960 --> 05:24.670
Who is that girl?!

05:24.670 --> 05:26.470
Wait, Miyako!

05:26.470 --> 05:27.760
- No!

05:29.180 --> 05:32.060
I don't want to hear it!

05:34.850 --> 05:36.350
Oh, that girl...!

05:37.270 --> 05:39.650
She's the gymnast from Biwa High School...

05:39.650 --> 05:42.190
...Sazanka Yashiro.

05:42.190 --> 05:46.860
- What is she doing with Chiaki?!

05:44.570 --> 05:46.860
- Don't ask me!

05:47.780 --> 05:49.370
Listen, Yashiro...

05:49.370 --> 05:51.620
Why are you so cold towards me?

05:52.370 --> 05:53.950
Do you...

05:55.160 --> 05:56.750
...hate me?

05:57.960 --> 05:59.380
Chiaki-san?

05:59.960 --> 06:05.840
- She's a crafty one. Guys are helpless against a girl's tears.

05:59.960 --> 06:02.170
- It's not that... it's just...

06:02.170 --> 06:05.840
- But... But we're...

06:05.840 --> 06:08.760
...not just childhood friends anymore.

06:09.930 --> 06:13.180
What does that mean?!

06:13.180 --> 06:14.770
But that's...

06:14.770 --> 06:18.810
Are you thinking about cancelling our <i>kon-yaku?!</i>

06:14.770 --> 06:18.810
kon-yaku = engagement

06:21.150 --> 06:22.860
<i>Kon-yaku?!?!</i>

06:24.360 --> 06:27.070
Oh, it's <i>kon nyaku!</i>

06:27.070 --> 06:31.570
When you want to eat healthy at night, it's best to use <i>kon nyaku</i> as noodles!

06:31.570 --> 06:37.290
- I read it in a book about dieting...

06:33.740 --> 06:37.290
- It's pretty obvious that we've been eavesdropping...

06:37.580 --> 06:40.960
Oh, you girls are from Momokuri Academy...

06:40.960 --> 06:42.170
You know each other?

06:42.170 --> 06:43.380
Yes...

06:46.460 --> 06:50.550
We've competed against each other in the rhythmic gymnastics so of course I know them.

06:52.760 --> 06:55.680
I'm looking forward to the tournament tomorrow.

06:57.560 --> 07:01.560
So am I. We won't lose against Biwa High School...especially you!

07:01.560 --> 07:04.860
You're Kusakabe-san, right?

07:04.860 --> 07:07.570
I cannot lose against you.

07:09.360 --> 07:14.450
Chiaki-san talks about you a lot, so I made up my mind not to lose to you...

07:15.660 --> 07:18.250
...in either rhythmic gymnastics or love.

07:20.580 --> 07:22.460
Chiaki-san!

07:22.460 --> 07:26.050
Please come cheer for me tomorrow.

07:26.050 --> 07:31.050
I will perform my best for you.

07:34.970 --> 07:36.510
Hey, Yashiro!

07:38.180 --> 07:40.560
What's with her attitude?!

07:40.560 --> 07:45.400
Chiaki, what did she mean by "engagement?!"

07:45.400 --> 07:46.940
She's...

07:47.780 --> 07:48.940
Chiaki!

07:58.240 --> 08:00.450
<i>Do you want to go out with me?</i>

08:00.450 --> 08:01.960
<i>Quit joking.</i>

08:01.960 --> 08:05.250
<i>I'm not joking. I'm serious.</i>

08:05.250 --> 08:07.170
<i>It's a confession of love.</i>

08:07.750 --> 08:10.970
<i>You already have a girlfriend...</i>

08:12.260 --> 08:15.970
<i>So you were just toying with me.</i>

08:16.970 --> 08:18.560
Maron.

08:18.560 --> 08:19.770
What?

08:19.770 --> 08:23.140
You like Chiaki, don't you?

08:23.140 --> 08:25.480
Of course not! Why would I...

08:25.480 --> 08:27.480
It's okay with me...

08:27.480 --> 08:29.280
...if you're my rival!

08:29.280 --> 08:32.450
But not Sazanka Yashiro!

08:32.450 --> 08:34.950
I refuse to lose against her!

08:34.950 --> 08:36.450
Let's go!

08:44.960 --> 08:46.580
Sir!

08:46.580 --> 08:49.380
Miyako-san will win today, won't she?

08:49.380 --> 08:56.260
Let's hope so. She's been excited since last night.

08:56.260 --> 08:59.350
Don't rush, don't tighten up.

08:59.350 --> 09:02.140
Just do as you always do during practice.

09:02.140 --> 09:03.770
- Okay!

09:03.060 --> 09:03.770
- Maron...

09:03.770 --> 09:04.770
Fin...

09:04.770 --> 09:05.850
What's up?

09:05.850 --> 09:08.110
This gym feels weird!

09:08.110 --> 09:10.150
Weird? Do you think there's a Demon around?

09:10.150 --> 09:13.570
Yeah. I'll go look for it so you should be careful.

09:21.240 --> 09:23.950
I won't lose to you, Kusakabe-san.

09:26.170 --> 09:28.460
I won't hand them over...

09:29.960 --> 09:34.420
Neither Chiaki-san nor this beautiful trophy.

09:51.480 --> 09:55.280
Excuse me? Is Kusakabe-san here?

09:55.280 --> 09:58.570
Maron? Huh, she was here just a minute ago...

09:58.570 --> 10:04.660
I'm from Biwa High School and Sazanka-san said she wants to greet her.

10:04.660 --> 10:09.000
Greet her? That's nice... Okay, I'll go.

10:09.000 --> 10:11.960
- But she said Kusakabe-san...

10:10.460 --> 10:11.960
- It's okay. Where is she?

10:22.350 --> 10:24.560
The pain is getting worse.

10:24.560 --> 10:25.720
I might be unable to able to participate...

10:25.720 --> 10:27.390
- Yeah, you shouldn't.

10:27.390 --> 10:30.350
How can you perform in this condition?

10:30.350 --> 10:31.980
You could make it worse.

10:34.650 --> 10:36.070
Leave me alone!

10:37.280 --> 10:38.650
You see what I'm talking about?

10:48.160 --> 10:50.370
Sazanka-san, I'm here!

10:51.580 --> 10:54.550
Sazanka-san, where are you?!

10:57.840 --> 10:58.970
Sazanka-san?

11:08.310 --> 11:10.980
Notice

11:08.310 --> 11:10.980
Don't go away!

11:08.310 --> 11:10.980
I'll return right after these messages!

11:08.310 --> 11:10.980
Kaitou Jeanne

11:11.850 --> 11:14.480
Notice

11:11.850 --> 11:14.480
I'm back to continue my adventures

11:11.850 --> 11:14.480
Kaitou Jeanne

11:15.020 --> 11:16.610
Sazanka-san did that?

11:16.610 --> 11:20.820
This is her way of winning the tournament!

11:20.820 --> 11:22.990
I'll sue her for this!

11:22.990 --> 11:26.330
- No, I'll just tell the judges about...

11:25.330 --> 11:26.330
- Stop it.

11:27.830 --> 11:30.920
Chiaki, why are you stopping me?!

11:30.920 --> 11:33.500
Yashiro wouldn't do such a thing.

11:33.500 --> 11:34.500
But!

11:34.500 --> 11:36.550
I know her well!

11:40.510 --> 11:44.260
Maron, please beat her for me!

11:44.260 --> 11:46.510
It's just not fair!

11:46.510 --> 11:53.600
I was going to compete against her fair and square, but I can't do it at all now.

11:53.600 --> 11:57.690
I don't want to lose against her! Please!

11:57.690 --> 12:00.030
It's impossible, Miyako. Maron is...

12:00.030 --> 12:03.240
Okay, leave it to me!

12:06.240 --> 12:08.490
Wait, Maron!

12:08.490 --> 12:10.200
Leave me alone!

12:10.200 --> 12:12.500
Are you going to perform with that leg?

12:12.500 --> 12:14.630
Your injury could get worse!

12:14.630 --> 12:16.250
I don't care.

12:20.420 --> 12:21.720
What are you doing?!

12:23.090 --> 12:25.640
Why are you doing this?

12:25.640 --> 12:30.390
Do you also think Yashiro is behind Miyako's injury?

12:30.390 --> 12:32.100
Is that why you're pushing yourself?

12:32.100 --> 12:34.690
Is that why you want to win?

12:37.110 --> 12:44.110
Miyako is a strong girl. It's got to be pretty serious for her to give up.

12:44.110 --> 12:49.030
Miyako asked me to take her place, which is why I have to do this, no matter what!

12:50.330 --> 12:54.370
She also got injured because of me...

13:12.390 --> 13:14.890
You're so caring, Maron.

13:22.820 --> 13:24.610
You're the caring one, Chiaki.

13:26.410 --> 13:32.330
But if you're kind to everyone, your fiancée will hate that.

13:32.330 --> 13:35.710
My parents arranged for our engagement without my consent.

13:35.710 --> 13:37.290
It doesn't matter to me.

13:37.290 --> 13:38.580
That's not what it seems.

13:42.420 --> 13:44.590
I said it doesn't!

13:44.590 --> 13:45.670
Trust me!

13:50.680 --> 13:52.100
<i>There must be something wrong with me.</i>

13:52.100 --> 13:57.730
<i>I'm letting myself get too serious about it all...</i>

14:04.190 --> 14:08.410
<i>Who cares who Chiaki is engaged to...</i>

14:24.090 --> 14:31.220
<i>Biwa High School Sazanka Yashiro, ball apparatus score: 9.75.</i>

14:32.100 --> 14:37.730
What?! She's the best so far, damnit! Maron, it's up to you!

14:37.730 --> 14:39.100
Y...Yeah.

14:41.190 --> 14:42.400
Maron.

14:42.400 --> 14:44.110
Fin, what's the matter?

14:44.110 --> 14:45.690
I found the Demon. Come on.

14:47.530 --> 14:49.660
Hey, Maron! Where are you going?

14:49.660 --> 14:51.120
Where's the Demon?

14:51.120 --> 14:54.700
In the staff room. It's inside the trophy for this tournament.

14:55.990 --> 15:01.920
Also, when I left the notice card I spotted Access, so I bet Sinbad will come as well.

15:04.130 --> 15:05.710
Sinbad...

15:07.420 --> 15:11.720
Perfect timing! I was in such a bad mood!

15:11.720 --> 15:15.310
Beating Sinbad will be the perfect stress relief!

15:15.310 --> 15:18.520
Don't forget about the Demon, though.

15:23.690 --> 15:26.530
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

15:37.200 --> 15:39.120
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

15:39.120 --> 15:40.910
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

15:40.910 --> 15:42.500
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

15:45.420 --> 15:46.800
<i>Game Start!</i>

15:47.210 --> 15:49.760
Jeanne, how's your leg? Are you okay?

15:50.920 --> 15:52.380
I can do it!

15:54.720 --> 15:59.220
Everyone, get in position! We will guard the place!

15:59.220 --> 16:02.900
Today is the end of Jeanne and Sinbad!

16:02.900 --> 16:03.600
Yes, ma'am!

16:11.030 --> 16:13.610
Miyako Special, Part Eight!

16:13.610 --> 16:16.580
Take it if you dare, Jeanne!

16:17.330 --> 16:23.000
Miyako, I know you're angry because you couldn't compete, but don't push yourself too hard.

16:23.000 --> 16:27.420
What should we do, Jeanne? We can't get any closer!

16:27.420 --> 16:29.510
I'll aim from outside. Let's go!

16:34.590 --> 16:36.720
I won't let you have it.<i></i>

16:36.720 --> 16:40.470
I won't let you have my trophy!<i></i>

16:40.470 --> 16:41.890
Sazanka-san?

16:41.890 --> 16:43.730
It's the Demon!

16:46.610 --> 16:48.020
The Petit Claire is reacting!

16:48.020 --> 16:48.770
Jeanne!

16:56.110 --> 16:57.410
Sinbad!

16:57.410 --> 17:00.120
I told you to quit being a Kaitou, Jeanne.

17:00.120 --> 17:03.000
Besides, what can you do with that foot, anyway?

17:08.920 --> 17:10.250
I hate you.

17:11.800 --> 17:13.920
I'll never quit!

17:13.920 --> 17:16.470
I'll crush anyone who tries to take my Rosario away!

17:21.810 --> 17:24.020
Yashiro. Damn it!

17:24.020 --> 17:26.480
Jeanne!

17:34.700 --> 17:37.410
You've really done it this time, Miyako.

17:37.410 --> 17:39.700
I can't get inside.

17:44.410 --> 17:45.500
A fan?

17:51.130 --> 17:53.630
I have to aim through there...

17:53.630 --> 17:54.590
But...

17:56.220 --> 17:58.300
Can I really do it?

18:12.320 --> 18:15.030
No, I have to do it!

18:15.030 --> 18:17.320
I'm always "matchless and marvelous."

18:18.410 --> 18:23.370
<i>You, a Demon born in the darkness, I seal you here!</i>

18:39.430 --> 18:41.220
<i>Checkmate!</i>

18:41.220 --> 18:42.640
GO!

18:54.900 --> 18:56.400
What was that sound?

18:56.400 --> 18:57.690
Check inside!

18:57.690 --> 18:58.700
Hurry!

19:06.330 --> 19:10.420
What? How did she steal it...?

19:11.710 --> 19:13.710
DAMN IT!!!

19:14.630 --> 19:16.000
<i>Collection completed!</i>

19:17.300 --> 19:21.010
I've taken another deceptive beauty today!

19:22.430 --> 19:29.810
<i>Final performance, ribbon #16: Momokuri Academy sophomore, Kusakabe Maron.</i>

19:29.810 --> 19:32.310
Calm down, Kusakabe!

19:32.310 --> 19:35.270
You have to beat Sazanka Yashiro!

19:35.270 --> 19:36.400
Yeah!

19:36.400 --> 19:37.530
- Go for it, Maron!

19:39.030 --> 19:40.030
Chiaki...

20:21.530 --> 20:22.490
<i>Trust me!</i>

20:24.200 --> 20:26.490
<i>You're so caring, Maron.</i>

20:28.910 --> 20:30.410
<i>Trust me!</i>

20:35.130 --> 20:36.210
<i>I'm...</i>

20:40.710 --> 20:45.220
<i>...probably in love with Chiaki...</i>

21:06.410 --> 21:11.660
<i>Momokuri Academy's Kusakabe Maron, ribbon apparatus score...</i>

21:11.660 --> 21:13.660
<i>9.85</i>

21:16.210 --> 21:18.210
She did it!

21:18.210 --> 21:24.220
Maron! You won! Maron!!

21:24.220 --> 21:27.590
Way to go!

21:27.590 --> 21:32.180
<i>I did it... I won... All because of Chiaki...</i>

22:05.420 --> 22:11.260
For billions of years,

22:11.350 --> 22:20.810
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:22.980 --> 22:29.450
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.700 --> 22:35.750
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.370 --> 22:39.170
The huge mountains...

22:41.880 --> 22:48.800
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.300 --> 22:53.850
It took everything.

22:56.100 --> 23:02.060
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.150 --> 23:09.070
we watched the world ending...

23:09.280 --> 23:15.120
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.240 --> 23:24.920
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.760 --> 23:37.060
Why?! Why has Miyako been possessed by a Demon?! Unforgivable!

23:37.060 --> 23:41.190
I'm worried about Miyako's body! We must hurry up and <i>Checkmate!</i>

23:41.190 --> 23:43.900
Maron, the target is the papier mâché medal.

23:43.900 --> 23:46.360
No way! How could that make her suffer?!

23:46.360 --> 23:52.450
It's something I made... I made it and gave it to Miyako...

23:51.240 --> 23:52.450
- What?!

23:52.450 --> 23:56.830
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: The Medal of Friendship Possessed by the Demon

23:56.830 --> 23:59.290
Please! Give Miyako back to me!
